THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The four files in stream/ (squaremap.ytd, circlemap.ytd, minimap.ytd and
minimap.gfx) are the community-standard minimap shape masks and cleaned-up
minimap graphics, as distributed with the QBCore qb-hud resource. They are not
the work of this project's author and are not covered by the License or by the
attribution above. Replace them with your own if your distribution needs to.

Everything else in this repository was made for it:

  - The stomach growl is synthesised at runtime in html/js/sound.js. No audio
    file ships with this software.
  - The warning lamps, gauge icons and instrument faces are drawn as SVG in
    this repository.
  - No font file ships with this software. The stylesheet names a stack of
    fonts already present on the host and falls through to a generic family.

The instrument clusters follow the conventions of real vehicle dashboards:
numbered dials, a redline, standard tell-tale symbols and colours. Conventions
are not owned by anyone. No third-party asset, glyph, font, sound or trademark
is included or claimed beyond the stream/ files named above.


